  "returns": "record",
  "version": 2,
  "status": "published",
  "description_nl": "2026-10-08: The numbers of an earlier year's tax (FY 2015-16 to 2025-26): the slabs, 87A and cess from chip myreturn.slabs_by_year; the special rates - 111A 15% (20% from 23 July 2024), 112A 10% over 1 lakh (from FY 2018-19; 12.5% over 1.25 lakh from 23 July 2024, the 1.25 lakh for all of FY 2024-25), 112 20% with indexation (12.5% from 23 July 2024), 115BB / 115BBJ / 115BBH 30%; the surcharge - 12% over 1 crore (FY 2015-16), 15% over 1 crore (2016-17), 10% / 15% over 50 lakh / 1 crore (2017-18, 2018-19), then 25% over 2 crore and 37% over 5 crore (Finance (No. 2) Act 2019; the new regime's top 25% from FY 2023-24), at most 15% on 111A / 112A gains (from FY 2019-20) and on 112 (from FY 2022-23). known false: no such year / regime (the new regime before FY 2020-21).",
